.TH batten-generate-schema 1  "batten 0.0.61" 
.SH NAME
batten\-generate\-schema \- Emit the JSON Schema for a config surface, derived from the config types
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten generate schema\fR [\fB\-\-surface\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Emit the JSON Schema for a config surface, derived from the config types
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-surface\fR [default: authority]
Which config surface to describe: the committed authority, or the override layer
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
authority: The committed authority: `batten.toml`
.IP \(bu 2
override: The raise\-only override layer: `batten.local.toml`
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.0.61
